WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Confirm the identifier
Illustrative AIO order: inspect its exact correlation-id header.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Choose explicit topics
Search the source and destination; this is a bounded trace.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Set the value and time range
Match the case-sensitive header and review the UTC interval.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Run the trace
The read searches retained records without committing consumer offsets.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Check coverage, not just matches
The empty destination does not explain why delivery stopped.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Choose the next check
Check emission and consumer progress. Absence remains bounded by coverage.
